**Auto-Departure:** {cfg['auto_departure']['enabled']} ({cfg['auto_departure']['wait_hours']} hrs)
**Server Limit:** {cfg['max_servers_per_user']}
**Allowlist:** See `{ctx.clean_prefix}botaccess set allowlist`
**Main Servers & Roles:** See `{ctx.clean_prefix}botaccess set mainservers`
**Welcome Message ({cfg['user_messages']['welcome']['enabled']}):** {cfg['user_messages']['welcome']['text'] or DEFAULT_THANKS_MSG}
**Expiration Message ({cfg['user_messages']['expired']['enabled']}):** {cfg['user_messages']['expired']['text'] or DEFAULT_EXPIRE_MSG}
**Denial Message:** {cfg['denial_message'] or DEFAULT_NO_ACCESS_MSG}
        """.strip()
        embed = discord.Embed(title="BotAccess Settings", description=desc, color=await ctx.embed_color())
        await ctx.send(embed=embed)

        # Show user stats
        user_stats = ""
